     1,
     "Hi Vincent,<div><br></div><div>I see you changed in the implementation the reading of the sleep log.</div><div><br></div><div>Old (<a href=\"https://rdrr.io/cran/GGIR/src/R/g.loadlog.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/cran/GGIR/src/R/g.loadlog.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw294FgIDROYhvwoPbZgX4Qg\">https://rdrr.io/cran/GGIR/src/R/g.loadlog.R</a>):</div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\">if </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">sleeplogidnum</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">==</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,128,0);font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/logical.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/logical.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20oZmD4vKQO8tgAVclCYq5\">TRUE</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">)</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">{</span>\r\n        <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">sleeplog[cnt</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">]</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/Round.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/Round.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Du7pMHoy4eSkGvNx2Ttxr\">round</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">S[j</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">colid]</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">)</span>\r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">}</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/Control.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/Control.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fE4uvLaWjgcMz7frneFeg\">else</a></span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">{</span>\r\n        <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">sleeplog[cnt</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">]</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/character.html\" style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/character.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2g5uP32A2-yZme094FOWzO\">as.character</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">S[j</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">colid]</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">)</span>\r\n      <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">}</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">New - removed the </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:inherit\">sleeplogidnum</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> parameter </span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;white-space:pre-wrap\">(<a href=\"https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/399c85cbd8091321d63d5eadb505be295f65f77b/R/g.loadlog.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/399c85cbd8091321d63d5eadb505be295f65f77b/R/g.loadlog.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zhB9AvDylr3GUU5gih-em\">https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/399c85cbd8091321d63d5eadb505be295f65f77b/R/g.loadlog.R</a>):</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-spacing:0px;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(36,41,47);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sleeplog</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">cnt</span>,<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">1</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> as.character(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">S</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">j</span>,<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">colid</span>])</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sleeplog</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">cnt</span>,<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">2</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">#</span>ifelse(deltadate &gt; 0, yes = i, no = i + abs(deltadate))</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\">  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sleeplog</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">cnt</span>,<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">3</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">dur</span></span></span></span></span><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><br></span></span></div>I don&#39;t know if this has something to do with the following error.</span></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">My ID is not recognized when running analysis wit advanced sleep log, despite it is detected when running the analysis without sleep log (</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;white-space:pre-wrap\">GGIR part2 csv-report</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;white-space:pre-wrap\">).</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">I get the following error:</span></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\"><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\"> Part 4 \r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in sleeplog[cnt, 1] &lt;- as.character(S[j, colid]) : \r\n  replacement has length zero\r\nIn addition: Warning message:\r\n\r\nNone of the IDs in the accelerometer data could be matched with the ID numbers in the sleeplog. You may want to check that the ID format in your sleeplog is consistent with the ID column in the GGIR part2 csv-report, and that argument coldid is correctly set. </span></span></span>\r\n\r\n</span></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">BR,</span></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">Vesna</span></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">\r\n</span></span></div>"
