     1,
     "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">GGIR open-source software. The support we give here is entirely voluntary.</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">So, it would be great if you could make an effort to help us understand and replicate your problem.</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><ol><li><span>What is your ID format, can you share an example?</span></li><li>What versions of GGIR are you comparing?</li><li>With input arguments have you been using GGIR?</li><li>What sensor brand and data type are you working with?</li><li>What have you done to investigate the problem yourself? Have you tried other datasets with different ID formats and did that work? Have you tried changing the IDs in the sleeplog?</li></ol><div><br></div></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Thanks,</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Vincent</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Dr. Vincent van Hees | Independent consultant | </span><a title=\"https://accelting.com/\" href=\"https://accelting.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883511000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0q44b6Ionzf1w2WIm5-Ybz\">https://accelting.com/</a><br></div><div><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/1eab6ff62456c6/image?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\"><br></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n            <div>\r\n        \r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div>\r\n        ------- Original Message -------</div>"
