     3,
     "<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n            Hi Vincent,<div><br></div><div>I see you changed in the implementation the reading of the sleep log.</div><div><br></div><div>Old (<a href=\"https://rdrr.io/cran/GGIR/src/R/g.loadlog.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/cran/GGIR/src/R/g.loadlog.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883511000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31pcQqqAXFdLGH_WbDd8F5\">https://rdrr.io/cran/GGIR/src/R/g.loadlog.R</a>):</div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;white-space:pre-wrap\"> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\">if </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">sleeplogidnum</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">==</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,128,0);font-weight:bold\"><a style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/logical.html\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/logical.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489883511000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lOXS_11VYcmkIsPEbo0lm\">TRUE</a></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">)</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">{</span>\r\n        <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">sleeplog[cnt</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit\">]</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a style=\"box-sizing:inherit;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(65,131,196)\" href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/Round.html\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl